<section>
  <h2>FAQ</h2>

  <h3>Can I trick the ATS?</h3>
  <p>Some people hide keywords in white text or off-screen. Don't. Many ATS detect this, and recruiters hate it when they discover it. Optimize honestly.</p>

  <h3>Do all companies use ATS?</h3>
  <p>About 98% of Fortune 500 companies and 66% of large companies use ATS. Small businesses (under 50 employees) often don't.</p>

  <h3>Should I put my photo on my resume?</h3>
  <p>In the US, no - photos confuse ATS and can introduce bias. In Europe and some other regions, photos are standard (check local norms).</p>

  <h3>How do I know if I passed ATS?</h3>
  <p>You usually don't. If you don't hear back within 2 weeks, you likely didn't pass. Our ATS checker gives you a preview before submitting.</p>
</section>

